  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO/Juan Bosch Prize for the Promotion of Social Science Research i</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This prize, sponsored by the Government of the Dominican Republic, was instituted in 2009. It rewards every two years young Latin American and Caribbean researchers whose work has made a significant contribution to the strengthening of links between research and public policy in the field of social sciences, and is worth $10,000 and a diploma.</narrative>
